			<div class="content" id="post-content-3860611">
									

<blockquote>
<p>Tofflemire: Because… we needed to fall down SCP-4000 to move the plot forward.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I think if this was anything else besides Sloths Pit I would have downvoted right there, heh.</p>
<p>Admittedly, my knowledge of Sloths Pit is limited (only read ihp's prop and have a basic knowledge of the concept), but I really enjoyed this. The characters are great, I really dig the giant spooky man dragging them down the hole, I like the Foundation's reaction to stuff going on here (&quot;don't fucking talk about it, you'll make it worse!&quot;), and I really liked that little rhyme at the end.</p>
<p>But really, let's face it. The +1 here is for digging so deep you reach China.</p>

